    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86872" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προγᾰμ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>live with</i> a woman <i>before marriage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.1.8
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, of a woman, <i>to be married before,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Syr.</u>
				68
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>marry first</i> or <i>before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.304
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>live in wedlock before</i> or <i>already</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				183.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>.</div>
